<title>USA: TSI TelSys names Peter Campisi CFO.</title>
<headline>TSI TelSys names Peter Campisi CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>TSI TelSys Corp said Tuesday it named Peter Campisi as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Campisi, who will oversee TSI's financial management and investor relations, previously served as chief financial officer of DavCo Restaurants Inc and Blue Cross and Blue Shield of Maryland Inc.</p>
<p>TSI TelSys was not immediately available to comment on whom, if anyone, Campisi replaces.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
